From b918bb0abe9bdc7f86bfd00e44874e1ff32fb439 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: George Haragos <george.haragos.6@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 07:40:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] App: quick test (one place, its result alone); spoken
 instructions off at every start

- "Quick test: one place" on the before-we-start screen records the upper chest, left,
  then shows the result for that place only: one row, the front map with one dot, and a
  note that only one place was checked (also in the shared summary and earlier checks).
- Spoken instructions are off every time the app opens; the switch turns them on for
  that visit only.
- Tests: the quick test and voice-off in flow; the language checks no longer expect
  October in the date.

